### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### Create a new user
# @name createUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "age": 30
}

### Set the createdUserId variable from the response
@createdUserId = {{createUser.response.body.id}}

### Get all users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Accept: {{contentType}}

### Get a specific user by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{createdUserId}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### Update a user
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{createdUserId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "John Updated",
  "age": 31
}

### Delete a user
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{createdUserId}}